# ---------------- The countryside, round 2 (2026-11-11): wider country ----------------

@place fennick_farm
name: The Fennick Farm
region: countryside
map: home 300,150
discover: met(tobias)
open: noon afternoon evening
art: leaf
desc: Up on the upland side, past the tarn, outside the two villages: turnips, tomatoes, a mother who writes the weather first and love last, and Tobias in his oldest boots.

@place almanac_printers
name: The Almanac Printer's
region: countryside
map: home 665,350
discover: met(nessa)
open: noon afternoon
art: paper
desc: A crooked shop off the market green with a hand press in the window. It prints the valley's almanac, its notices and its funeral cards, and Nessa grew up above it.

@place countryside_ford
name: The Ford
region: countryside
map: home 445,275
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: wave
desc: Where the road meets the river: stepping stones when it's low, a ferryman's punt when it's not, and a ferryman who never seems to cross himself.

@place hollin_coppice
name: Hollin Coppice
region: countryside
map: home 497,562
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: tree
desc: A wood cut and grown again for longer than anyone remembers: charcoal burners' smoke, bluebells in season, and trees marked in chalk by a woodward nobody hired.

@place countryside_tarn
name: The Tarn
region: countryside
map: home 165,250
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: moon
desc: A small black lake high on the upland, cold even in summer, so still on calm days that the sky looks deeper in it than it does overhead.

@place countryside_quarry
name: The Quarry
region: countryside
map: home 97,412
open: morning noon afternoon
art: rune
desc: An old stone quarry on the valley's western edge, its faces full of fossils and its echo full of opinions.

@place drovers_inn
name: The Drovers' Inn
region: countryside
map: home 141,318
open: noon afternoon evening night
art: cup
desc: The inn on the high road west, where drovers, tinkers and anybody the coaching inn wouldn't have end up: cheap beer, a long table, and a fight most nights.
